/-!
# The concrete carrier for the simply connected D4 construction

This interface exports the closed Clifford Spin carrier, its semisimplicity
and nontriviality, and the natural Spin-to-Omega point map. In characteristic
two that point map is a group isomorphism. The pinned torus and the regular
triality and Frobenius realizations are separate parts of the construction;
none is inferred from this point-group isomorphism.

Sources: GLS3, §§1.10–1.15 and 2.1–2.3.
-/
